# REELYOU Brand — Locked Logo (Permanent)

The official REELYOU logo and wordmark are **approved production assets**. Treat them as locked on every screen.

## Single source of truth

- Assets: `src/assets/branding/reelyou-logo-*.png`, `src/assets/branding/reelyou-icon.png`
- Component: `src/components/branding/BrandLogo.tsx`
- Constants: `src/constants/branding.ts`

## Approved logo files

- `reelyou-logo-light-no-tagline.png` — UI on dark backgrounds
- `reelyou-logo-dark-no-tagline.png` — UI on light backgrounds
- `reelyou-logo-light-with-tagline.png` — brand-first screens on dark backgrounds
- `reelyou-logo-dark-with-tagline.png` — brand-first screens on light backgrounds
- `reelyou-icon.png` — limited-space contexts only

## Do NOT (ever)

- Redraw, recreate, approximate, or substitute the logo
- Use Text, SVG, Canvas, icons, or custom drawing for the brand mark
- Change spacing, proportions, colors, shadows, or metallic finish
- Duplicate logo code per screen
- Place logos inside white containers

## Required on every screen

```tsx
import { BrandLogo } from '@/components/branding/BrandLogo';

<BrandLogo backgroundTone="dark" />
```

Scale with the `width` prop only. Preserve aspect ratio. Use `includeTagline` only on welcome, splash, and onboarding.

## Future updates

Change `BrandingAssets` or `BrandLogo` once — the entire app updates.
